    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Gunsmith's tools enable a character to create firearms and produce ammunition.</p><p><strong>Components.</strong> Gunsmith's tools include a ball-peen hammer, sets of screwdrivers, pin punches, files and pliers, safety goggles with amplifying lenses, rulers and squares, cleaning rods, grease and oil bottles, a powder horn, a small mortar and pestle, and lastly, screws and springs.</p><p><strong>Crafting Firearms.</strong> If you are proficient with gunsmith's tools, you can craft a pistol or rifle over the course of one workweek (5 days of 8 hours of work) by spending 50 gp worth of materials and resources.</p><p><strong>Crafting Bullets.</strong> If you are proficient with gunsmith's tools, as part of a long rest, you can make bullets in batches of 6 + double your proficiency bonus. You need to spend 1 gp in materials per batch you make.</p>",
